       "awb---integration-feature-2": "<h3>When partners differ by 3 points, sales steps in</h3><p>Moorhaven Home's quiz asks each partner to rate the firmness they like on a 10-point scale. When the ratings differ by 3 or more, a salesperson gets a Slack alert with both sets of answers and calls the couple. In March, 23 of the 90 couples who took the quiz got that call.</p>",
       "acrm---key-feature-3-image": {
        "fileId": "6afac85748e3fac96cc9b1f8",
        "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a0f028de6df6a6fd88c3f89/6afac85748e3fac96cc9b1f8_uc-3.svg",
        "alt": "A furniture store's couples quiz compares each partner's firmness rating out of 10, and when two ratings differ by 3 or more a salesperson gets a Slack alert; 23 of 90 couples did in March."
       },
       "acrm---key-feature-4-image": {
        "fileId": "6afac85748e3fac96cc9b1fe",
        "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a0f028de6df6a6fd88c3f89/6afac85748e3fac96cc9b1fe_uc-4.svg",
        "alt": "A mattress review site's March count shows 1,240 quiz takers, 512 on soft foam and 391 on hybrid, and the editor puts 3 soft foam models on April's review list."
       }
      }
     },
